From ffb4bf532a66938354756b21d364548bb7718a82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rpc: expose adaptive fee estimates and admit transactions
 once

Expose local admission, relay and wallet recommendation rates and current
adaptive-capacity/history availability through RPC. Enforce the caller's maximum
fee and the RPC hysteresis floor within the same ATMP before any mempool
insertion. Remove both redundant preflights: the congestion dry run and the
older broadcast maximum-fee dry run. Other admission callers retain defaults.

Count actual single-transaction admission attempts. Test one accepted RPC call
and fee-limit rejections, including no insertion on failure. Move the existing
RPC estimate test here so each prerequisite boundary tests methods that exist.

Original-Commit: 1e3b144a4d743cf802e0a3a90e9a4367da034b77
Original-Patch: ecash/029
Split-Concern: rpc

